---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Write 2–3 short paragraphs here: what you work on, what you're good at, and what kind of role
      you're looking for. Mention your degree or background if relevant.
    </p>
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, TypeScript, SQL</li>
      <li><strong>ML:</strong> PyTorch, scikit-learn, Hugging Face</li>
      <li><strong>Engineering:</strong> Git, Docker, CI/CD, REST APIs</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, or find me on
      <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
